      "content": "I get the \"optimization\" angle, but I'm worried it's too vague. If they ask for specifics, like \"what exactly are we missing right now that the current tier doesn't catch?\", what should I tell them? Can we point to any specific vulnerabilities or gaps in their current setup to make the case for the upgrade more concrete?",
